  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 1.04,
      "text": "What if Goku joined the"
    },
    {
      "start": 1.04,
      "end": 1.98,
      "text": "Avengers?"
    },
    {
      "start": 1.98,
      "end": 4.06,
      "text": "Earth's insurance company is cooked."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.06,
      "end": 4.8,
      "text": "Tony sees the hair and"
    },
    {
      "start": 4.8,
      "end": 5.98,
      "text": "asks, is that in the"
    },
    {
      "start": 5.98,
      "end": 6.92,
      "text": "dress code?"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.92,
      "end": 7.78,
      "text": "Brother, your team hired a"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.78,
      "end": 9.84,
      "text": "green rage fridge. Relax."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.84,
      "end": 11.18,
      "text": "In this crossover, Thor calls"
    },
    {
      "start": 11.18,
      "end": 12.62,
      "text": "himself a god."
    },
    {
      "start": 12.62,
      "end": 14.52,
      "text": "Goku hears free training partner."
    },
    {
      "start": 14.52,
      "end": 15.6,
      "text": "Congratulations."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.6,
      "end": 16.88,
      "text": "The welcome party now needs"
    },
    {
      "start": 16.88,
      "end": 18.2,
      "text": "a demolition permit."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.2,
      "end": 19.32,
      "text": "Captain America says they need"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.32,
      "end": 20.04,
      "text": "a plan."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.04,
      "end": 21.2,
      "text": "My guy, this man thinks"
    },
    {
      "start": 21.2,
      "end": 22.96,
      "text": "strategy means screaming until his"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.96,
      "end": 23.784295175023654,
      "text": "hair updates."
    },
    {
      "start": 23.784295175023654,
      "end": 25.1843125,
      "text": "Then they order lunch."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.1843125,
      "end": 26.9643125,
      "text": "Motherflicker, they need a second budget."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.9643125,
      "end": 28.5643125,
      "text": "Goku calls it a snack."
    },
    {
      "start": 28.5643125,
      "end": 29.7643125,
      "text": "Tony calls his accountant."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.7643125,
      "end": 31.144312499999998,
      "text": "Thanos starts the usual galaxy"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.144312499999998,
      "end": 32.044312500000004,
      "text": "speech."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.044312500000004,
      "end": 33.6243125,
      "text": "Goku asks, are you strong,"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.6243125,
      "end": 35.1643125,
      "text": "or just purple and unemployed?"
    },
    {
      "start": 35.1643125,
      "end": 36.6243125,
      "text": "All that villain aura."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.6243125,
      "end": 37.6443125,
      "text": "Suddenly he is getting checked"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.6443125,
      "end": 39.0243125,
      "text": "like carry on luggage."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.0243125,
      "end": 40.0043125,
      "text": "But Goku gives the bad"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.0043125,
      "end": 41.7043125,
      "text": "guy a chance to power up."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.7043125,
      "end": 43.0043125,
      "text": "Oh, fantastic."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.0043125,
      "end": 44.184312500000004,
      "text": "Our emergency has a premium"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.184312500000004,
      "end": 45.184312500000004,
      "text": "subscription."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.184312500000004,
      "end": 46.5643125,
      "text": "The Avengers are begging him"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.5643125,
      "end": 47.56859035004731,
      "text": "to finish the fight."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.56859035004731,
      "end": 48.8685625,
      "text": "He wants a rematch."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.8685625,
      "end": 50.1885625,
      "text": "This walking side quest needs"
    },
    {
      "start": 50.1885625,
      "end": 51.4285625,
      "text": "adult supervision."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.4285625,
      "end": 52.3085625,
      "text": "Still, they would want him"
    },
    {
      "start": 52.3085625,
      "end": 53.4085625,
      "text": "protecting Earth."
    },
    {
      "start": 53.4085625,
      "end": 54.3685625,
      "text": "Just keep him away from"
    },
    {
      "start": 54.3685625,
      "end": 55.7685625,
      "text": "mission planning and the grocery"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.7685625,
      "end": 56.5885625,
      "text": "card."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.5885625,
      "end": 57.7685625,
      "text": "Would he save the team,"
    },
    {
      "start": 57.7685625,
      "end": 59.1085625,
      "text": "or bankrupt it before the"
    },
    {
      "start": 59.1085625,
      "end": 59.968562500000004,
      "text": "next invasion?"
    }
  ],
